-The parent method that provides the sorting, projection, and rasterization framework [5625-hardware-assisted-projection.md].
+### Hardware-Assisted Projected Tetrahedra
+Uses linear opacity approximation, leading to artifacts. [Hardware-Assisted Projected Tetrahedra](1729-hardware-assisted-projected-tetrahedra.md)
